# A guard comparing the thread index with a CTA index, read under the
# record's grid. In set_mla_kv_buffer_kernel_norope
# `8·(%tid.x mod 128) + 1024·%ctaid.y < 576` guards a 16 B load and
# store. The grid is 8192x1x1, so %ctaid.y is 0: the store runs on 72
# threads of each CTA, 589824 times over the launch, as the record
# measures, and line 93 is no longer listed as differing.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/b200/rope_kv__deepseek-v3__prefill__sgl_mla_set_norope.set_mla_kv_buffer_kernel_norope.sm_100a.ptx --ncu %fixtures/b200/rope_kv__deepseek-v3__prefill__sgl_mla_set_norope.set_mla_kv_buffer_kernel_norope.sm_100a.ncu.json | FileCheck "%s"
CHECK: grid: 8192x1x1 CTAs
CHECK: kernel set_mla_kv_buffer_kernel_norope
CHECK: st.global.v4.b32  global store 16 B on 72 threads in 3 warps (8 * (%tid.x mod 128) < 576)
CHECK: totals per CTA [static]:
CHECK: global bytes: load 2176 B, store 1152 B
CHECK: measured
CHECK: line 88: @%p1 ld.global.v4.b32 { %r1, %r2, %r3, %r4 }, [ %rd3 + 0 ];  predicted 589824, measured 2686976  (CS2R x2, LDG.E.128 x1)
CHECK-NOT: line 93:
